{"slug":"zhidong-zhang","title":"Penumbra Workspace Program | Finalist | 2025","nav":"Zhidong Zhang","desc":"Zhidong Zhang © Zhidong Zhang","img":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/f5922c62-64f0-4819-a2f4-dd5d6370235f/7+-+Residues+-+fbb212cd-9763-4d44-9f96-9a03b8d8b0f7.jpg","updated":1781112614979,"blocks":[{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":10,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<h3>PENUMBRA WORKSPACE PROGRAM | <strong>FINALIST</strong> | 2025<strong> </strong></h3>"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><a href=\"https://workspace-residency-2025\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">All residents  →</a></p>"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<h3><strong>ZHIDONG ZHANG</strong></h3>"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":6,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/3cbd0973-e5ec-4882-9fc3-4d1f5586e5c4/16+-+Studio+Study+-+84990d8c-964b-4788-bf00-1219e71a7ec3.jpg","alt":"Image © Zhidong Zhang. Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Zhidong Zhang. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":1500,"h":1071,"href":null,"fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":6,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Zhidong Zhang</strong> is a visual artist based in Brooklyn, New York. Zhang’s practice embraces the reconstruction of visual materials as sites of political potential. Working in photography and installation, their work investigates how image-making becomes a form of historical intervention, reimagining narratives and spaces that cultivate alternative modes of understanding and belonging.<br/><br/>Zhang’s work has recently been exhibited at Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway, MassArt Art Museum, Chengdu Contemporary Image Museum, Centre régional de la photographie, and has appeared in publications including The Boston Globe, i-D Magazine, The New York Times, The New Yorker, Boston Art Review, and among others. Recent awards and fellowships include Creator Labs Photo Fund, Collective Futures Fund, and Massachusetts Cultural Council Fellowship. They have been an artist-in-residence at MASS MoCA, Center for Photography at Woodstock, Boston Center for the Arts, TILT Institute for the Contemporary Image, and a participant at the Skowhegan School of Painting and Sculpture.</p><p><a href=\"https://zhidongzhang.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">zhidongzhang.com</a></p>"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1747239573065-5N1A3N4GC3DDQARSFHNW/1+-+Bananas+with+Fingerprints+-+bf4a3aef-a6fc-4de6-afe4-02b895f9d248.jpg","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 2","cap":"","w":1500,"h":1200},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1747239344729-TMEI1CXVYFO5F38CKRRZ/2+-+Cactus+-+760f36c6-f061-4818-8291-9e1936ac4c8d.jpg","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 3","cap":"","w":1200,"h":1500},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1747172471321-ZLPYB1AVY2AMEVS0GPH3/9+-+Two+Boats+-+58de9a3b-409a-4e8b-a72f-3b90ba6c3308.jpg","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 4","cap":"","w":1500,"h":1200},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1747239184109-C5O7RP8KBIXJVPWJ2DS7/14+-+Balloon+Dog+-+55c9f241-68e1-4709-a09a-3b6c34de25a1.jpg","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 5","cap":"","w":1500,"h":1232},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1747239030586-LLEX6GM8MCMPG2MEQC51/13+-+Backyard+Portrait+-+31074121-18e0-4c44-ab71-60196e83f280.jpg","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 6","cap":"","w":1200,"h":1500},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1747239031263-DVVUJCHEZFTVL5FILH1P/15+-+Reflections+-+3543c0cc-9254-4f04-a139-9d1d31cb7d05.jpg","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 7","cap":"","w":1500,"h":1200}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<h3>SPONSORS</h3><p>This program is sponsored by <strong>Joy of Giving Something </strong>and the <strong>Phillip and Edith Leonian Foundation</strong>.</p>"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/8b5d24af-b2ef-413d-97d7-90e3d4dce54b/Screenshot+2026-02-09+at+11.50.43%E2%80%AFAM.png","alt":"zhidong-zhang — image 8","cap":"","w":800,"h":302,"href":null,"fp":"0.5,0.5"}]}